/P 1591 0 R
/E (MOT, the Sovereign and Corporate bonds regulated market, it was launched in 1994 and is the European leader for turnover and trades. The aim of MOT is to facilitate the access to the bond market for private investors and enhance the efficiency of professional investors operations. Via its two segments DomesticMOT and EuroMOT, it is dedicated to the trading of Italian and EU government securities, domestic and international bank and corporate bonds, supranational and asset-backed securities for retail investors. It involves a large number of investors \(both retail and institutional\). This market leads in trade volumes thanks to institutional investors, e.g. pension funds, that need to periodically liquidate their positions and re-balance their portfolios. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5 6]
>>
endobj
