465 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Trade and Distribution Services \(Market Venues and Segments\) Euronext offers a range of trading venues for bond markets, which are organised into regulated and unregulated segments.  On the regulated side, Euronext provides access to markets like MOT \(for retail bond trading in Italy\), as well as other national markets integrated under its alliance. It also operates unregulated markets such as MTFs that serve institutional clients and offer more flexibility in terms of trading rules and product types.  These venues use advanced platforms that allow the automatic matching of buy and sell orders according to the bid-ask matching and order priority. These systems are designed to process high volumes of transactions. The infrastructure is fully electronic and supports a wide range of order types. )
/E (Trade and Distribution Services \(Market Venues and Segments\) Euronext offers a range of trading venues for bond markets, which are organised into regulated and unregulated segments.  On the regulated side, Euronext provides access to markets like MOT \(for retail bond trading in Italy\), as well as other national markets integrated under its alliance. It also operates unregulated markets such as MTFs that serve institutional clients and offer more flexibility in terms of trading rules and product types.  These venues use advanced platforms that allow the automatic matching of buy and sell orders according to the bid-ask matching and order priority. These systems are designed to process high volumes of transactions. The infrastructure is fully electronic and supports a wide range of order types. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
