/T (Here the Cross-chain and Multichain technologies are introduced, as the ability of two or more blockchain systems to operate together, despite differences in their networks, consensus mechanisms and smart contract languages, without worrying about compatibility issues. There are two ways to implement interoperability, via multi-chain platform or cross chain network: )
