/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 1645 0 R
/T (A multi-chain platform aims to create a decentralised infrastructure that connects different blockchains and enables their communication in a single ecosystem. These are often permissioned, they add security by restricting access to specific nodes, reducing the risk of unauthorised manipulation. Already existing solutions are Cosmos \(ATOM\), Polkadot, Chainlink.)
/E (A multi-chain platform aims to create a decentralised infrastructure that connects different blockchains and enables their communication in a single ecosystem. These are often permissioned, they add security by restricting access to specific nodes, reducing the risk of unauthorised manipulation. Already existing solutions are Cosmos \(ATOM\), Polkadot, Chainlink.)
/Pg 19 0 R
>>
endobj
570 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 1646 0 R
/T (A cross-chain network, through an orchestration layer, a middleware, connects different blockchains, allowing applications to send data, assets, or commands across networks through a unified interface, without directly coding for each chain. Existing solutions are Axelar or LayerZero. )
/E (A cross-chain network, through an orchestration layer, a middleware, connects different blockchains, allowing applications to send data, assets, or commands across networks through a unified interface, without directly coding for each chain. Existing solutions are Axelar or LayerZero. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
