/E (However, several risks and challenges remain. The centralised nature of the Digital Euro could introduce a single point of failure, raising resilience concerns. Moreover, the regulatory framework is still evolving and could impose constraints on the full integration of the Digital Euro into blockchain-based financial systems, as well as              ------)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [8 9]
