/E (In this section of the report the focus will be on the key regulations that must be considered to address the topics of Blockchain and Digital bonds. First, it is important to understand the general regulatory part to which are subjected Digital bonds, and for this the consideration will be on the DLT Pilot Regulation \(and the Italian application Decreto Fintech\), MiFID II, MiFIR, Prospectus Regulation; while considering AML and MAR for what concerns matters of anti-money laundering and market abuse. Regarding MiCA Regulation, it is essential for the administration and custody of crypto assets on behalf of investors. Finally, considering the implementation of Blockchain in Euronext Securities and Euronext Clearing, the attention will be focused on the CSDR \(Central Securities Depository Regulation\).)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
