/T (CSDR The Central Securities Depository Regulation is the European Regulation that regulates the activities of CSDs and came into force on 17/09/2014. The aim of the Regulation is to enhance the safety and efficiency of CSDs, to define common rules for all CSDs and to introduce a standard framework to deal with settlement failures.)
/E (CSDR The Central Securities Depository Regulation is the European Regulation that regulates the activities of CSDs and came into force on 17/09/2014. The aim of the Regulation is to enhance the safety and efficiency of CSDs, to define common rules for all CSDs and to introduce a standard framework to deal with settlement failures.)
