/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (In the Reconciliation Process of the Regulation, the objective is to ensure the integrity of the issuer and to provide some verification measures done by the CSDs to check the safety of every transaction. Communications Standards are defined during communication procedures with clients to facilitate securities transactions. Then a set of measures regarding settlement processes is defined in the Settlement Discipline: the measures aim at preventing, monitor and manage settlement failures. All CSDs are required to record the LEI code \(a univocal code that identifies a single client\) of every client in their databases; because of this, issuers and intermediaries need to obtain a LEI code and report it to the CSD.)
/E (In the Reconciliation Process of the Regulation, the objective is to ensure the integrity of the issuer and to provide some verification measures done by the CSDs to check the safety of every transaction. Communications Standards are defined during communication procedures with clients to facilitate securities transactions. Then a set of measures regarding settlement processes is defined in the Settlement Discipline: the measures aim at preventing, monitor and manage settlement failures. All CSDs are required to record the LEI code \(a univocal code that identifies a single client\) of every client in their databases; because of this, issuers and intermediaries need to obtain a LEI code and report it to the CSD.)
