/T (ESMA T+1 The aim of ESMA is to increase the efficiency of the settlement cycle by going from T+2 to T+1. ESMA recommends that the migration to T+1 occurs simultaneously across all relevant instruments and that it is achieved in Q4 2027, recommending 11/10/2027 as the suggested date of migration.)
/E (ESMA T+1 The aim of ESMA is to increase the efficiency of the settlement cycle by going from T+2 to T+1. ESMA recommends that the migration to T+1 occurs simultaneously across all relevant instruments and that it is achieved in Q4 2027, recommending 11/10/2027 as the suggested date of migration.)
/Pg 26 0 R
