764 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Issuers will have access to the issuance platform on the blockchain, through which they are responsible for providing regulators and investors with all the necessary legal documentation, such as the prospectus and required financial statements, for each bond issuance. Additionally, they ensure that all information is accurate, transparent, and compliant with regulatory standards, thereby enabling a smooth and trustworthy issuance process within the blockchain ecosystem. )
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [9 10]
>>
endobj
765 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
