968 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Technological features When we talk about technological features, we consider some critical attributes that influence in different ways their environmental impact.  First, the consensus algorithm used is relevant in terms of carbon and environmental footprint: analysis reveal that those such as Proof of Stake \(PoS\), Delegated Proof of Stake \(DPoS\), Proof of Authority \(PoA\) and Hybrid methods are significantly more environmentally friendly. These algorithms consume much less energy compared to Proof of Work \(PoW\) as they do not rely on an intensive mining process to validate transactions, which not only reduces their carbon footprint but also decreases the need for specialised hardware, making them more efficient and sustainable. PoW remains the standard security consensus algorithm in many blockchain networks, but its high environmental cost makes it a less viable long-term option in a world looking to reduce the carbon footprint.)
/E (Technological features When we talk about technological features, we consider some critical attributes that influence in different ways their environmental impact.  First, the consensus algorithm used is relevant in terms of carbon and environmental footprint: analysis reveal that those such as Proof of Stake \(PoS\), Delegated Proof of Stake \(DPoS\), Proof of Authority \(PoA\) and Hybrid methods are significantly more environmentally friendly. These algorithms consume much less energy compared to Proof of Work \(PoW\) as they do not rely on an intensive mining process to validate transactions, which not only reduces their carbon footprint but also decreases the need for specialised hardware, making them more efficient and sustainable. PoW remains the standard security consensus algorithm in many blockchain networks, but its high environmental cost makes it a less viable long-term option in a world looking to reduce the carbon footprint.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [25]
>>
endobj
